gory":"Delis","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Beer, Food, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","review_id":"XDvma2VBRvmvzn_81dSuwg","date":"2016-06-23T18:12:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.952521800994873,"text_excerpt":"Martin's is a great re-addition to the neighborhood. I spend more time on the retail side of the shopping/dining divide and the wine and spirit selections are excellent. The staff are super helpful and the little weekend tastings are a great thing to keep an eye on - often will have wine or liquors out. The restaurant is also impressive - good sandwiches and all kinds of other goodies. Cheese plate, smoked salmon plate, specials - all check out. The real sweet spot is being able to pick any bottle of wine in house, have it chilled in 5 minutes and enjoying it with your meal."},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","review_id":"PFUpq7FPoSCkdTVxcNyisQ","date":"2016-08-03T16:54:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9446772336959839,"text_excerpt":"Great wine selection, awesome food, not so great location...but overall, I enjoy coming here. The roasted vegetable sandwich is delicious; and HUGE! I wish I could go out to Martin's more often just to get that sandwich. There's tons of seating for a lunch crowd, so that's definitely a bonus, in addition to ample parking. The staff has always been super friendly towards me and helpful when deciding on a new wine to bring home."},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","review_id":"ocXLAb4N918aDQZB3F5cng","date":"2015-12-08T14:56:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9333560466766357,"text_excerpt":"Martin Wine Cellar is my favorite wine & liquor store. I also love their selection of specialty food items, their catering menu, and their cafe menu. I would consider Martin to be a high-end store, but they have unbeatable prices on their wide variety wine and spirits. They also regularly offer further discounts on their wine based on the volume you purchase (ie 20% entire purchase of 10 more bottles). The wine store is also full of knowledgable wine experts- they are super friendly and always happy to share their knowledge. Check their schedule to see when they are having their next wine tasting or happy hour- those are great too! Martin has been go-to spot for my mom & I for years for l..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","photo_id":"o_bVARV7rBKnTU8LCBjgIg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/o_bVARV7rBKnTU8LCBjgIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8502309322357178},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","photo_id":"Dlr8HsKSDrkGm2fT-L2VIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Dlr8HsKSDrkGm2fT-L2VIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8245313167572021},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","photo_id":"HTc22ooS3NS-5eCatOgpkw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HTc22ooS3NS-5eCatOgpkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8151776194572449},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","photo_id":"omkGCziskKDNGWattlyaHg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/omkGCziskKDNGWattlyaHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.798434853553772},{"business_id":"mq8iNBD77TP6eWfFIQO5rQ","photo_id":"W3ua5pKcEBA9rrnYNVoYtw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/W3ua5pKcEBA9rrnYNVoYtw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7608140110969543}]},"notebook_case":null}
